<urn:atm:triage:finding/AG18-QA-006>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "AG18-QA-006" ;
  triage:title "stale signature in doc sample" ;
  triage:description "Documentation samples in sprint-AG18.md (line 269) and sprint-AG21.md (line 77) show an Explicit Code Sample with signature: fn execute_outbound_send_with_runtime_and_post_send_emitter(dispatcher: &impl boundary::OutboundSendDispatcher, request: SendRequest, post_send_emitter: &dyn boundary::PostSendEmitter) -> Result<ResponseEnvelope, AtmError>. The trait parameter 'dispatcher: &impl boundary::OutboundSendDispatcher' does not exist in the actual implementation. The real implemented function in crates/atm-core/src/send/mod.rs takes different parameters without this trait-based dispatcher. The documented signature is stale and should be updated to match the actual implementation signature. Correlated finding: ATM-QA-005.ttl covers the same doc-sample staleness context. This is a doc-only fix that should land on the highest open branch (s25) before phase merge." ;
  triage:phaseId "phase-AG" ;
  triage:triageMode "followup_pass" ;
  triage:repeatable false ;
  triage:sweepScope "none" ;
  triage:category "documentation-signature-mismatch" ;
