  triage:notes "Followup pass confirms finding is STILL OPEN on AG.21 as reported by AG21-QA-2 (PR #580, commit bf96dc86). Sweep across s21-s25 confirms stale dispatcher trait parameter persists in documentation sample across all branches. This is a pure documentation fix with no code impact. Recommended fix: update sprint-AG18.md line 269 and sprint-AG21.md line 77 to show the actual implementation signature (without the non-existent OutboundSendDispatcher trait parameter). Fix should land on s25 (highest open branch) for merge-forward closure." .

